{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":35580,\"title\":\"Edgar Wallace Mysteries\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"The Edgar Wallace Mysteries was a British second-feature film series, produced at Merton Park Studios for Anglo-Amalgamated. There were 46 films in the series, made between 1960 and 1965.\\n\\nThe films were loose adaptations of Edgar Wallace's books and stories. Very few used his original titles, and there was no attempt to set them in the period in which Wallace wrote, probably to obviate the need for elaborate costumes and sets. A 1962 article in Scene magazine quotes £22,000 as the budget for an episode then in production.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/32j3G7BVtzCzS3Yxry27zEtEoK1.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":null,\"youtubeBackdrop\":\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/0Iks9OxZGmA/maxresdefault.jpg\",\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":7.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"year\":1959,\"genres\":[\"Mystery\",\"Drama\"],\"status\":\"Ended\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":10,\"totalEpisodes\":53,\"createdBy\":[],\"networks\":[],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"GB\",\"name\":\"GB\"},{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"1966-06-01\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":71012,\"name\":\"Geoffrey Nethercott\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":138167,\"name\":\"Peter Duffell\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":190495,\"name\":\"Alan Bridges\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9KLsBkxqPWLyvOLnW5aezbXE8nR.jpg\"},{\"id\":29646,\"name\":\"Charles Jarrott\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/glWUlZidfXmHc2PnGeUwxDVvUuh.jpg\"},{\"id\":1468651,\"name\":\"John Nelson-Burton\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":79925,\"name\":\"Herbert Wise\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/i33dO3Zcl3yC1UDWtVAFTLdY6oq.jpg\"},{\"id\":100097,\"name\":\"John Carson\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"htt